// expect: 42
// The absorption one wrapper deeper: `through` hands its own parameter to
// `bracket`, so its judgment instantiates bracket and the parameter's row
// becomes that instantiation's copy of bracket's quantified leaf. The copy
// carries an instantiation edge whose source renames to the copy itself, and
// it read as a CLOSED empty row (2026-09-24) — `through` published its
// parameter as Pure, and a thunk that performs Ping could not reach it. The
// copy is a variable of its own until something else arrives.
effect Ping { ping() -> Int }

handler pong {
  ping() => resume(7)
}

fn bracket(body) = body() ~> pong

fn through(g) = bracket(g)

fn caller() -> Int with !Ping = through(() => ping())

fn main() = caller() * 6
